Playwright (github.com/microsoft/playwright-python) and
Playwright MCP (github.com/microsoft/playwright-mcp)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The stored-login browser feature (anton/browser_login.py) uses the
Playwright Python package to drive a real, persistent browser session for
signing in. @playwright/mcp, installed as a pinned npm package inside the
published Docker image, is the MCP server a job uses to work with an
already-authenticated session's browser. Both are redistributed as part of
the image, not vendored source.

